---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Shipping & Delivery Policy | SatvaStones Jewellery"
  description="Pan-India shipping terms for SatvaStones anti-tarnish jewellery. Dispatched from Vapi, Gujarat within 24-48 hours. Free delivery above ₹499."
>
  <!-- Minimalist Legal Header -->
  <div class="bg-white border-b border-gray-100 py-10 sm:py-14">
    <div class="max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center space-y-2">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-full text-xs font-bold text-amber-800">
        <span>Vapi Atelier Direct Dispatch • Express Pan-India Courier</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 tracking-tight">Shipping &amp; Delivery Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        SatvaStones Fine Anti-Tarnish Jewellery • Sole Proprietorship of <strong>Anirudh A Verma</strong> • GSTIN: 24DDAPV4074H1ZF • Chala, Vapi, Gujarat - 396191, India.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-400">
        Last Updated: November 2026 | Free Delivery Threshold: ₹499 | Dispatch Window: 24–48 Hours
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 sm:py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8 bg-white p-6 sm:p-12 border border-gray-200 rounded-[26px] shadow-xs text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">

      <!-- Section 1: Dispatch Timeline from Vapi -->
      <section class="space-y-3 bg-gray-50 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-900 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#f2707f]"></span>
          <span>1. Dispatch Schedule &amp; Origin Atelier</span>
        </h2>
        <p>
          Every SatvaStones jewelry parcel is individually hand-inspected, wrapped in a protective anti-tarnish velvet suede pouch, accompanied by an authenticity care card, and dispatched directly from our atelier in <strong>Chala, Vapi, Gujarat - 396191, India</strong>.
        </p>
        <p>
          Orders placed before 2:00 PM IST on business days are typically processed and dispatched within <strong>24 to 48 hours</strong> (excluding national holidays and Sundays).
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2: Delivery Windows Across India -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">
          2. Estimated Delivery Timelines Across India
        </h2>
        <p>
          We partner with premium air express courier services (BlueDart Air Express, Delhivery Prime, Xpressbees) to ensure speedy delivery across India:
        </p>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 pt-1">
          <div class="p-3.5 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl space-y-1">
            <span class="font-bold text-gray-900 block text-xs">Gujarat &amp; Western India</span>
            <span class="text-[#f2707f] font-extrabold text-sm block">1 to 3 Business Days</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500">Ahmedabad, Surat, Mumbai, Pune, Vadodara, Rajkot, Vapi &amp; nearby zones.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3.5 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl space-y-1">
            <span class="font-bold text-gray-900 block text-xs">Major Metros</span>
            <span class="text-[#f2707f] font-extrabold text-sm block">2 to 4 Business Days</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500">Delhi-NCR, Bengaluru, Hyderabad, Chennai, Kolkata, Jaipur, Chandigarh.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3.5 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl space-y-1">
            <span class="font-bold text-gray-900 block text-xs">Rest of India &amp; North East</span>
            <span class="text-[#f2707f] font-extrabold text-sm block">3 to 6 Business Days</span>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-500">Tier-2/Tier-3 towns, Assam, Jammu &amp; Kashmir, Kerala interior, and remote pincodes.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3: Shipping Fees & Free Shipping Threshold -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">
          3. Shipping Fees &amp; Free Shipping Threshold
        </h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 pl-2">
          <li><strong>Orders of ₹499 and above:</strong> <strong class="text-emerald-700">100% Free Express Shipping</strong> across all serviceable pincodes in India.</li>
          <li><strong>Orders below ₹499:</strong> A nominal flat shipping and protective packaging fee of <strong>₹49</strong> is applied at checkout.</li>
          <li><strong>Zero Surcharges:</strong> We do not charge fuel surcharges, octroi, or hidden handling fees. All prices are fully transparent.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4: Live Tracking -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">
          4. Real-Time Tracking &amp; Notifications
        </h2>
        <p>
          As soon as your package is scanned by our courier partner in Vapi:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 pl-2">
          <li>You will receive an automated SMS and Email with your unique <strong>Air Waybill (AWB) number</strong> and direct tracking URL.</li>
          <li>You can track the live transit status at any time on our website at <a href="/track-order" class="text-[#f2707f] font-bold underline">www.satvastones.in/track-order</a> using your Order Number or Mobile Number.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 5: Undelivered / Lost Shipments -->
      <section class="space-y-3 bg-gray-50 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900">
          5. Undelivered &amp; Lost Shipments Guarantee
        </h2>
        <p>
          Our courier partners make up to <strong>3 delivery attempts</strong> to your specified address. If a delivery attempt fails due to customer unavailability or incorrect address:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 pl-2 text-xs">
          <li>You will receive an alert to reschedule the delivery slot.</li>
          <li>In the rare event that a package is declared lost or damaged in transit by the carrier, SatvaStones will immediately issue a <strong>free replacement piece</strong> or provide a <strong>100% full refund</strong> without hassle.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-xs pt-1">
          For shipping queries or address corrections before dispatch, contact: <a href="mailto:support@satvastones.in" class="text-[#f2707f] font-bold underline">support@satvastones.in</a> or Call/WhatsApp: <a href="https://wa.me/919016703180" class="text-[#f2707f] font-bold underline">+91 90167 03180</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
